WEBVTT

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:04.656
As a second proposal, we must focus

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:07.479
on water and nutrition.

00:07:09.011 --> 00:07:12.602
Access to safe and drinkable water

00:07:12.626 --> 00:07:16.562
is an essential and universal human right.

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:20.139
It is essential

00:07:20.163 --> 00:07:24.716
because it determines
the survival of people

00:07:24.740 --> 00:07:26.546
and therefore is a condition

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:30.660
for the exercise of all other
rights and responsibilities.